  "evidence_boundary": "Executes pinned PDFium's real FPDF_LoadMemDocument parser on deterministic synthetic PDFs, then FPDF_LoadPage, width/height/rotation queries, NewFormObj with 4-minus-page-turn, native vector form generation, and FPDF_SaveAsCopy/FILEWRITE. Input boxes, source path, overlay points, and content are synthetic host data. The source MediaBox, CropBox, Rotate, UserUnit, and source vector content are checked in exact serialized output. This does not execute SPen::PdfiumExportHandler::OpenWriter or PdfiumImpl::LoadPage, exercise a full Samsung StandardPDF export, prove arbitrary source-PDF preservation, or establish rendered pixel parity. Android platform services are explicitly bounded host providers and unknown imports abort the probe."
